    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="8" relname="span">I totally agree with you,</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="10" relname="span">I think that screen) layout, color, fonts, labeling, graphics, sound, visualization, presentation, interaction and spacing are very important in web design.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="12" relname="span">You can not explore a website</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="3" relname="concession">(even if it has great information)</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="12" relname="condition">if it does not capture your attention quickly.</segment>
        <segment id="6" parent="7" relname="volitional-cause">I have been turned off by horrible designs,</segment>
        <segment id="7" parent="13" relname="span">and I refuse to even explore a little bit.</segment>
